---

{title: Filhaal}
{artist: Praak Kuch Aisa Kar Kamaal}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
Ho kuch [F] aisa kar [Am] kamaal
Ke tera [Am]ho jaun,        Ho kuch [F]aisa kar [Em]kamaal
Ke tera [Am]ho jaun,        Me kisi [F]or ka hu [Em]filhaal
Me kisi or [Am]ka hu filhaal,        Ke tera [F]ho [Em]jaun
Me kisi or [Am]ka hu filhaal,        Ke tera ho jaun
Aye [F]gal tey [Em]galat aey,        Jo vi [Am]kar reha Jaani
Par [F]aey vi dekh tere [Em]bin,        [Am]Kinj mar reha Jaani
Ho mar [F]jaangey le sambhaal,        Ho mar [Am]jaangey le sambhaal
Ke tera ho [F]jaun [Em],        Me kisi [Am]or ka hoon filhaal
Ke tera ho jaun,        [F] [Em] [Am]
Mainu pa [F]ta ke duniya [Em]nu,        Ehh [Am]gawara ni ho sakda
Par [F]jhuth kehnde ne [Em]saare,        Ke pyaar [Am]dubaara ni ho sakda
Par jhuth [F]kendey ne [Em]saare,        Ke pyaar [Am]dobaara ni ho sakda
Tu mainu [F]puch na koi [Em]sawaal,        Chal [Am]durr kitte mere naal
Ke [Am]tera ho jaun,        Me kisi [F]aur ka hun [Em]filhaal
Me kisi [Am]aur ka hun filhaal,        Ke [F]tera ho [Em]jaun
Me kisi [Am]aur ka hun filhaal,        Ke tera ho jaun
Hun [F] rona me [Em] pachhtauna me
Ke [Am]chan ni hoya chakore da,        Hun [F]tu vi ae [Em]kise hor di
[Am]Me vi ann kise horda,        Hun [F]rona me [Em]pachhtauna me
Ke [Am]chan ni hoya chakore da,        Hun [F]tu vi ae [Em]kise hor di
[Am]Me vi aan kise hor da,        Mera [F]dil karda aey [Em]sawaal
Teri [Am]mohabbat da ki haal,        Ke tera [F]ho [Em]jaun
Me kisi [Am]aur ka hun,        Me kisi aur ka hu [F]filhaal [Em] [Am]
